talk!</span></p></div><span class=\"boot-screen-index\">Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"page-transition-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"page-transition-frame\"></div><span class=\"page-transition-mark\">L</span></div><div class=\"site site--loading\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"site-header-inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav-wrap\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"site-nav-desktop\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><button class=\"site-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4pb_\"><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-label\">Menu</span><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></span></button><div id=\"_R_4pb_\" class=\"site-nav-mobile\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-inner\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-links\"><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/buy\"><span>Buy</span><span>01</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/sell\"><span>Sell</span><span>02</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\"><span>Home Valuation</span><span>03</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/communities\"><span>Communities</span><span>04</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/reviews\"><span>Reviews</span><span>05</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link site-nav-mobile-link--active\" href=\"/team\"><span>Team</span><span>06</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/about\"><span>About</span><span>07</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Contact</span><span>08</span></a></div><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-cta\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home value <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></nav></div></header><main class=\"site-main\"><main class=\"editorial-page page-team\"><section class=\"editorial-hero team-hero\"><div class=\"editorial-hero-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Meet the team</p></div><div class=\"\"><h1 class=\"editorial-hero-title\">A family helping<em>Fox Cities families.</em></h1></div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-hero-description\">Diane, Shane, and Oliver Lathrop bring three generations of perspective to every search, sale, negotiation, and next step.</p></div><div class=\"editorial-hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation</a></div></div><div class=\"editorial-hero-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-footnote\"><span>Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span><span class=\"editorial-hero-footnote-line\"></span><span>Three generations</span></div></section><section class=\"team-intro\"><div class=\"team-intro-aside\"><span class=\"editorial-section-number\">01 — Our people</span><span class=\"team-intro-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">L</span></div><div class=\"team-intro-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>More perspective at the table</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">A depth of experience<em>you can feel.</em></h2></div><div class=\"team-intro-copy\"><p>A strong real estate experience depends on more than one person trying to manage every detail. The Lathrop Team brings different strengths, shared local knowledge, and a consistent focus on making each decision clearer.</p><p>That depth shows up in how we price, how we market, how we negotiate, and how we stay present from the first conversation through closing.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"team-profiles\"><div class=\"team-profiles-heading\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>The Lathrop Team</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">Meet the people<em>behind the guidance.</em></h2></div><div class=\"editorial-team-grid\"><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-team-card\"><div class=\"editorial-team-portrait editorial-team-portrait--diane\"><img alt=\"Diane Lathrop, Realtor with the Lathrop Team\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"editorial-team-photo\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/team/diane.png\"/><div class=\"editorial-team-portrait-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"editorial-team-portrait-index\">01</span><div class=\"editorial-team-portrait-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"editorial-team-portrait-descriptor\">Experience / Perspective</span></div><div class=\"editorial-team-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-team-card-header\"><div><p class=\"editorial-team-role\">Realtor®</p><h2>Diane Lathrop</h2></div><span class=\"editorial-team-card-index\">01</span></div><div class=\"editorial-team-stat\"><span class=\"editorial-team-stat-value\">21+</span><span class=\"editorial-team-stat-label\">Years of experience</span></div><p class=\"editorial-team-bio\">With over 21 years of experience in the Fox Cities market, Diane has helped hundreds of families buy and sell homes locally. Independent rankings place her in the top 0.17% of agents in Appleton, with 996 closed sales recorded on Zillow.</p><div class=\"editorial-team-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204289227\">(920) 428-9227</a></div><p class=\"editorial-team-license\">License #<!-- -->62326-94</p></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-team-card\"><div class=\"editorial-team-portrait editorial-team-portrait--shane\"><img alt=\"Shane Lathrop, Realtor with the Lathrop Team\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"editorial-team-photo\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/team/shane.jpg\"/><div class=\"editorial-team-portrait-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"editorial-team-portrait-index\">02</span><div class=\"editorial-team-portrait-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"editorial-team-portrait-descriptor\">Local knowledge / Guidance</span></div><div class=\"editorial-team-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-team-card-header\"><div><p class=\"editorial-team-role\">Realtor®</p><h2>Shane Lathrop</h2></div><span class=\"editorial-team-card-index\">02</span></div><div class=\"editorial-team-stat\"><span class=\"editorial-team-stat-value\">444</span><span class=\"editorial-team-stat-label\">Listings and sales tracked on Zillow</span></div><p class=\"editorial-team-bio\">Shane has lived near the valley his entire life, giving him a nuanced understanding of how the Fox Cities market moves. Zillow tracks 444 team listings and sales under his profile, reflecting years of active work in pricing, marketing, and negotiation.</p><div class=\"editorial-team-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:shane@lathropteam.com\">shane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204280066\">(920) 428-0066</a></div><p class=\"editorial-team-license\">License #<!-- -->79092-94</p></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-team-card\"><div class=\"editorial-team-portrait editorial-team-portrait--oliver\"><img alt=\"Oliver Lathrop, Realtor with the Lathrop Team\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"editorial-team-photo\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/team/oliver.jpg\"/><div class=\"editorial-team-portrait-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"editorial-team-portrait-index\">03</span><div class=\"editorial-team-portrait-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"editorial-team-portrait-descriptor\">Modern marketing / Service</span></div><div class=\"editorial-team-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-team-card-header\"><div><p class=\"editorial-team-role\">Realtor®</p><h2>Oliver Lathrop</h2></div><span class=\"editorial-team-card-index\">03</span></div><div class=\"editorial-team-stat\"><span class=\"editorial-team-stat-value\">45</span><span class=\"editorial-team-stat-label\">Recent sales tracked under his license</span></div><p class=\"editorial-team-bio\">Oliver represents the third generation of the team and brings a modern perspective to marketing and client service. He has 45 recent sales tracked under his license and focuses on clear communication, detailed market research, and strong presentation.</p><div class=\"editorial-team-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:oliver@lathropteam.com\">oliver@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19208584424\">(920) 858-4424</a></div><p class=\"editorial-team-license\">License #<!-- -->88364-94</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"team-contact-band\"><div class=\"team-contact-band-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">L</div><div class=\"team-contact-band-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow editorial-eyebrow--light\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Let’s talk</p><h2>The right move starts<em>with the right conversation.</em></h2><p>Whether you are buying, selling, or simply thinking ahead, we are here to listen, answer questions, and help you map the next step.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact the Lathrop Team <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><p>A three-generation Fox Cities real estate team bringing local perspective, documented performance, and personal guidance to every move.</p><a class=\"footer-text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"footer-navigation\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Explore</p><div class=\"footer-nav-links\"><a href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a href=\"/team\">Team</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Direct contact</p><address><p><strong>Diane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204289227\">(920) 428-9227</a></p><p><strong>Shane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:shane@lathropteam.com\">shane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204280066\">(920) 428-0066</a></p><p><strong>Oliver Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:oliver@lathropteam.com\">oliver@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19208584424\">(920) 858-4424</a></p></address></div><div class=\"footer-map\"><div class=\"footer-map-header\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Office location</p><span>Appleton, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"footer-map-frame\"><iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2857.210069477556!2d-88.46770222396349!3d44.26449767107976!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x8803b7a5ba3b6f2d%3A0x6b0d2f80904d9e2f!2sKeller%20Williams%20Fox%20Cities!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1788252496599!5m2!1sen!2sin\" title=\"Keller Williams Fox Cities office location in Appleton, Wisconsin\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0\" allowFullScreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe></div></div></div><div class=\"site-footer-compliance\"><div class=\"footer-kw\"><div class=\"footer-kw-heading\"><p>Keller Williams Fox Cities</p><img alt=\"Keller Williams Fox Cities\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"132\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"footer-kw-logo\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/PLACEHOLDER-KW-LOGO.jpg\"/></div><address>517 N. Westhill Blvd, Appleton, WI<br/>Each office is independently owned and operated.</address></div><div class=\"footer-compliance-marks\"><div class=\"footer-compliance-mark\"><img alt=\"Equal Housing Opportunity\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/PLACEHOLDER-EQUAL-HOUSING.jpg\"/><span>Equal Housing Opportunity</span></div><div class=\"footer-compliance-mark\"><img alt=\"REALTOR®\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/PLACEHOLDER-REALTOR-MARK.jpg\"/><span>REALTOR®</span></div></div></div><div class=\"site-footer-bottom\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Lathrop Team. All rights reserved.</p><div><span>Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span><span>RealTrends Verified · 525+ five-star reviews</span></div></div></footer></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-c382ed19c2311dcb.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[5948,[\\\"214\\\",\\\"static/chunks/214-628d75f432f1dabd.js\\\",\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"356\\\",\\\"static/chunks/356-ba125e9f1b9f7c55.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/a